WEBVTT

00:01:52.160 --> 00:02:00.530
Long ago, we, the gods, descended to the lower world
of you, our children, seeking excitement.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:03.740
And so, we made a decision.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:08.570
We would live here in the lower world forever.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:16.280
Sealing our godly powers away, we would live happily,
surrounded by discomfort and inconvenience.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.450
Some of us descended here in search of entertainment.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.700
Others, in search of a hero.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.700
And one...

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.620
...in search of redemption.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:55.490
Ready!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.990
I'm late! I'm gonna be late to work!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.530
How come you didn't wake me up, Bell?!

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.120
I tried to wake you up a few times.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.620
Bell!

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.490
Yes?

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.950
Do your best out there.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.030
I will!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.280
Be back later, Goddess!

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.160
I'd better hurry too!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:36.030
Mornin', adventurer! Off to the Dungeon?

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:36.910
Yep!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:38.660
You're off to an early start today.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.410
Good morning!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.820
Here, take this.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:43.780
Thank you!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.490
Look! It's Little Rookie!

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.240
Morning!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.160
Morning.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:48.870
Good luck!

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:49.910
Thanks!

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.450
Good morning, Miss Syr!

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.120
Indeed. Here's your lunch for today.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:58.700
Thanks, as always.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:03.200
Meow... Where'd Ryu run off to?
Right when we're super busy!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.530
W-watch where you're goi-

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.320
Oh no, the dishes!

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:09.740
Tsk! Anya, pay attention!

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.490
Is Miss Ryu not here?

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:12.820
No, it looks like she's out today.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:15.320
Do you know where she might have gone, Bell?

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.240
I don't. Sorry.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.570
That's all right.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.240
Well, I'll be sure to say something if I see her, okay?

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.120
I'd appreciate that.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.280
You got it!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:27.950
Phew...

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:33.820
Good morning!

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.320
Ah, Bell!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.450
What are you up to, Miss Eina?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.910
Just getting ready for the festival tonight.
Are you heading to the Dungeon?

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:41.570
Yep!

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:43.910
Be careful! An adventurer shouldn't-

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.410
...go looking for adventures!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.030
Huh?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.530
I know!

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:49.280
That Bell...

00:04:58.820 --> 00:04:59.740
Lili! Welf!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:00.950
There he is.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:01.990
Master Bell!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.870
Sorry I'm late.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:06.620
Well?

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:07.700
Shall we?

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:09.950
To the Dungeon.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:22.950
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick up Girls in a Dungeon?

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:22.950
Theatrical Release

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.490
Welf!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.780
I've got this!

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.320
Get down!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.160
Wha-?!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.620
You should be more observant, Master Welf.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:54.870
My bad.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.070
By the way... Master Bell?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:57.910
Hm?

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.490
Will you be going to the festival tonight?

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.200
Yeah, that's the plan.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:04.870
Well then, is it all right if I come with you?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.820
Of course. What do you say, Welf?

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:11.280
How about... after we earn a few more coins?

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:12.820
I'm in.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:13.950
Agreed.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:29.120
Whoa! Check this out!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.700
Neither of you have been to
the New Moon Festival before, huh?

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.530
New Moon Festival?

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:43.120
Yeah! It's a holiday we've been celebrating
since before the gods descended.

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:48.870
I'm pretty sure people pray to the moon
for safety against evil monsters... I think.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.740
It's like part of the lower world's culture, huh?

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:54.530
With all the adventurers around,
I can see why Orario celebrates it.

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.530
Bell, look! Let's get some fried squid!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.530
G-Goddess!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.410
Please, d-don't pull me like that!

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:04.620
Lady Hestia?

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:09.740
Don't you think you should be selling
Potato Poppers at the festival tonight?

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.740
Business is booming...

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:16.740
Well, I heard some alley cat's been
trying to seduce my Bell here,

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.620
so I begged and weaseled my way out of work tonight.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.240
Who are you calling an alley cat?!

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:28.450
You take advantage of the fact that you're a goddess
to do all sorts of things to Master Bell all the time!

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:29.320
Excuse me?!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:30.740
Excuse me!

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.780
C-could you two not make a scene right now?

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.370
Welf, help me out here!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.120
Right! Time for some takoyaki! Let's eat!

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.280
Welf...

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:42.240
Come one, come all!

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:46.950
Those far away, feast your ears now!
Those who are near, feast your eyes as well!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.780
Is that...?

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:52.990
And finally, those confident in
their physical strength, come forward!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.490
Come! Who is the hero who will remove the spear?

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.490
What does Hermes think he's up to now...?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:03.450
Only the chosen one will be able to pull
the legendary spear from this stone.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:08.160
The goddess of chastity will surely
bless the one who claims it.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:13.240
On top of that, we're inviting the winner
on a luxurious trip around the world!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.950
Pre-authorized by the Guild, of course!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.910
A legendary spear?

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:24.370
Not another one of Master Hermes' shady contests...

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.990
Doesn't it sound fun, though?

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:28.700
You should go for it, Bell!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.990
Oh, sure!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:33.660
Shall we try it out too, Miss Ais?

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.450
Mm... okay.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.700
W..Wallen-whatsit!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.780
Lady Hestia? And Bell Cranel!

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.990
Miss Ais, we can't lose to the likes of them!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:52.530
Bell, our Familia's reputation is at stake here!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.280
Uh, I don't think this is that kind of competition...

00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:58.910
Do it!

00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:59.570
Come on!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.240
Damn it! It's stuck!

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:04.490
Come! Who shall be our next challenger?

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.200
Me! I'll do it!

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.410
It's no use... It won't budge an inch.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:14.570
My dear Lefiya! That's it? Giving up so soon?

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.370
Well, who's next?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.740
Oh-ho! Look who it is!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:23.370
The Sword Princess herself, Miss Ais Wallenstein, is up!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.120
Pull it out, Sword Princess!

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:33.240
Now, a test of Ais Wallenstein's true strength!

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.530
You can do it, Miss Ais!

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:39.870
No. I can't do it.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.700
No way! Not even Miss Ais, at Lv.6?

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.320
All right, Bell!

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.820
Time to show that Wallen-whatsit who's boss!

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:49.910
Good luck, Master Bell!

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.120
Have fun, kid.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:55.990
Th-there's no way a Lv.2 like you can remove the spear.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.740
What was that?

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.240
Come! Who shall be our next challenger?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.370
Oh... Are you up next, Bell?

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:07.070
Yes. I'd like to try as well, please.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:10.370
All right, time for Little Rookie to test his might!

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.450
I found you.

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.200
Huh?

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.030
Interesting...

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.410
So fate chooses you.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:36.490
You did it! Bell!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.950
Hooray!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.870
Good job, Bell.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.950
I never thought he'd actually do it.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.990
Did you see that?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.200
No way!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:50.070
Yes way! My darling Bell towers above the rest!

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:53.030
Your Wallen-whatsit's got nothing on him!

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:54.410
Congratulations, Bell.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:57.820
Oh... You know, I'm not even sure what happened...

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:02.820
Well then, I think it's time to reveal
the sponsor of our prize trip.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.320
Sponsor?

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:12.370
Artemis! What are you doing here?!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.700
Do you know her?

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:16.910
We used to be super close back in Heaven!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.410
She's one of my best friends!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.570
Artemis!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.320
Huh?

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.320
I found you! My Orion!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:39.660
Ori...

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:40.870
...on?

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:53.740
Huh?

00:11:54.030 --> 00:12:00.780
Wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-wha... What the heck?!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.030
What the heck do you think
you were you doing, Artemis?!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.070
Sorry... I was just so happy.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.030
Happy about WHAT, though?!

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:14.620
G-Goddess, we've never met before, have we?

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.120
Huh? Hermes!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.320
Are you sure that's Artemis?!

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.820
She's acting weird!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:30.700
Well, maybe life in the lower world's
had an effect on Artemis as well.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:32.070
That's stupid!

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:34.950
What did she used to be like, then?

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:36.990
This Lady Artemis.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:41.950
Artemis is one of Heaven's maiden goddesses.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.070
She's the patron of purity and protector of chastity.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:49.660
So I guess you could say she's the president
of the No-Sex-Before-Marriage Club.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.910
And she's definitely anti-romance.

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.370
Anti-romance...?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.950
That's why I'm so confused!

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.870
But why would the goddess of anti-romance
become the sponsor or whatever?

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:05.370
In truth, it's because a monster
has appeared outside of Orario.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.370
Outside Orario?

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:13.910
Yes. The Artemis Familia discovered it,
and it turned out to be quite the foe...

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.740
so she came to Orario in search of help-

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:18.990
So, the grand prize trip was all a lie, then?

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:23.530
And this is really just a quest from
Lady Artemis to exterminate a monster...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.030
Is that it?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.700
My, how very perceptive!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.990
I knew it was too good to be true...

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.160
That's fraud, Master Hermes.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.450
Well, you know...

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:41.820
I've been searching all over for you, Orion.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.570
But my name is Bell Cranel-

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.740
No, you're Orion.

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:50.030
You're my only hope.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.280
But why me?

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:56.070
There are plenty of others who
are stronger than I am, like Miss Ais...

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:59.200
The right to wield this spear is
not determined by one's strength...

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.490
but by the purity of one's soul, untouched by corruption.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.530
Master Hermes, this spear-

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.200
I told you, it's a legendary spear!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.370
A weapon certified by Hephaistos herself!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.120
And the spear chose you, Bell!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.160
It chose...

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.160
The spear chose me?

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:30.410
I need that pure soul of yours
with me on this journey, Orion.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.410
I...

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.870
Hey!

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.620
That hurt, Hestia.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.660
Yeah, well I'm hurt too!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.820
Are you okay?

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.410
Th-thanks...

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:48.870
Oh, all right!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.320
Artemis, I accept your quest!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.030
G-Goddess?

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.660
I can't just leave a friend hanging when she's in trouble!

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:02.820
Thank you, Hestia! I mean it, really!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:09.160
B-besides, I can't afford
to just leave you alone with Bell...

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:14.200
Then I want to go too! I'll expect a reward
upon completion, of course.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.620
Well, I guess I might as well jump on board too.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.990
Well, Bell, that just leaves you.

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:26.450
Although, I have a feeling you've already decided.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:32.570
All right. I accept your quest.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.070
Thank you, my kind children.

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:44.620
You may not be part of my Familia,
but starting now, we're friends on this journey.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:46.870
May I have your pledge of faith?

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:48.570
Uh...

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.450
Bell, kiss it! Kiss it!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.820
Uh... F-forgive me.

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:57.950
Wait a sec!

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:01.240
Lili... Lili...

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:04.620
A-an indirect kiss with Master Bell...

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:07.530
Hurry up already, Lil Squeak.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.370
Hm? What are you crying for?

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:16.870
Stupid, stupid Master Welf! I hate you!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.370
Hey, what's that for?! Ow, ow, ow!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:21.450
Well, now that everything seems
to be in order, shall we be off?

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.410
What?!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:24.870
What do you think?

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:29.570
The entire assortment was custom-made to
my personal specifications as an adventuring expert.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:34.240
Crafted with hand-picked materials
for optimal stretch and light weight, of course!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:40.450
I had rare metal shards folded into the raw materials
for an incredible 30% increase in durability!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:44.820
It may look like mere cloth, but this battle gear
provides as much protection as any armor

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.030
without restricting the wearer's movement at all!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:52.570
Only I, the one and only Hermes, could have procured
such masterpieces in the short time we...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.370
You look great, Bell.

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:57.410
Thank you. Yours looks great as well, Goddess.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.410
No one's even listening...

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:03.280
You think so? I thought I looked pretty good too, but I dunno...

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.320
Master Welf, are you bringing a magic sword with you?

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:06.870
I guess if you think it looks good, then it must look good, Bell!

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:06.870
Hm? Yeah...

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:08.820
Just in case.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:16.910
So, if we're traveling outside of Orario,
why are we up here on the outer wall?

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.280
Dunno...

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.030
Artemis?

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.570
Are you listening for something?

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:24.160
No, not at all.

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.120
Hermes, what are we doing here?

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.620
There they are.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:38.740
Goddess!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.240
G-Ganesha?!

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.950
Indeed! 'Tis I, Ganesha!

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.820
Are we gonna ride these there?

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:52.570
Correct.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:55.280
I took the liberty of arranging things with Ganesha.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:18:00.490
On the road, our journey would take a month,
but on dragonback, it's a mere 10 days' ride from here.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:04.530
And the longer I'm gone, the angrier Asfi will be with me...

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.320
What? What do you-

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:11.820
Hey! Stop that, it tickles! Hey!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.120
Not to worry!

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.820
I've been taming these dragons
since the day they hatched!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.200
They'll follow anyone's orders.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.700
Hey, aren't we missing a few dragons?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.070
Yep! Couldn't gather enough!

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.530
Well, it sounds like we'll be riding in pairs then.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:24.530
Pairs...?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:25.910
Bell!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.870
Will you...

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:28.370
ride with...

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:32.820
me...

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.200
Now, now...

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:37.990
What the heck?!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:41.200
Safe travels!

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:48.370
How are you doing?

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:49.160
Huh?

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:50.870
You're not afraid?

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:52.280
Afraid?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:57.160
It's dark, we're high up...
and dragons can be a little scary...

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.990
I mean, even I'm getting butterflies up here...

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.820
Your heart's beating faster.
Is that what you mean by butterflies...?

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.320
Hey! Artemis!

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:11.070
Bell is my family, got it?!

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:11.950
Calm down!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:12.820
Lemme go!

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.570
You're going to fall!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.740
What? You expect me to sit here and do nothing?!

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.490
What are they doing?

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.070
I said calm down!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:19.780
Master Hermes!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.410
Are you going to tell us where we're going now?

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:32.910
Our destination is across the continent,
in a land far, far from Orario.

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:37.780
A place hidden away in a sea of trees,
known as the Ruins of Ersos.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:14.450
My, what a nice breeze!

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.070
I swear, I could stay up here forever!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.620
You just keep telling yourself that...

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:23.910
It's been a week. This crap's boring. Right, Bell?

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.410
Nothin' but forest...

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:33.240
Fly down!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:33.870
Huh?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:34.620
Quickly!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.490
R-right!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.200
What is going on?!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.070
Whoa.

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:52.200
We're not done yet. Turn us around!

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:52.740
On it!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.990
Fire Bolt!

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:00.910
What was that?

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:01.950
Did you hear that?

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:02.870
We've got trouble!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:05.030
Master Bell is gone!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:06.950
Bell!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.200
Fire Bolt!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.120
There's too many of them!

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.160
Fire-

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:19.740
No, they're too close!

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:23.160
Lady Artemis!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:55.740
Lady Artemis!

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:04.120
There they are!

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:04.950
Down below!

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:06.620
What the hell are those monsters?

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:09.530
We need to get to Master Bell, quick!

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:13.200
Bell... Artemis...

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:20.990
Please, reach her!

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:24.740
What the-?

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:33.070
No way...

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:43.950
My gods...

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:46.280
Was that the power of the spear...?

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:51.320
Lady Artemis!

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:53.070
Are you all right?

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:53.950
Yes.

00:22:59.320 --> 00:23:02.070
Please don't risk your neck like that again, Lady Artemis.

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:04.320
Risk...? What do you mean?

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:06.490
W-well...

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:09.070
I mean, y-you're a girl.

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.240
My grandpa told me women should be protected...

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:13.490
So I just...

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:21.410
No one's ever said that to me before.

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:26.620
You know, despite my looks,
I'm actually far stronger than Hermes or Hestia.

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.530
Either way...

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:30.740
Artemis! Bell!

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:32.280
Are you both okay?

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:33.200
Yes.

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:36.910
I know you're strong,
but you shouldn't risk your neck like that!

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:41.370
Your child just told me that very same thing.

00:23:42.780 --> 00:23:44.280
So cool!

00:23:44.280 --> 00:23:45.870
It's really fast too!

00:23:45.870 --> 00:23:47.030
Whoa!

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:49.070
We're incredibly indebted to you.

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:51.200
I can't thank you enough.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:52.620
I-it's no problem, really...

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:55.570
Have either of you seen those monsters before?

00:23:55.570 --> 00:24:00.320
No... We heard them attacking the village nearby,
then suddenly they were right on us...

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:02.570
I sure haven't seen anything like them.

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.160
Think it's because we're not in Orario?

00:24:04.160 --> 00:24:06.370
I'm sorry I can't be of more help to you.

00:24:06.370 --> 00:24:07.240
Bell.

00:24:07.490 --> 00:24:09.990
Try not to use that spear too much. It's dangerous.

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:13.620
S-sure. Master Hermes, is this spear-

00:24:13.620 --> 00:24:17.320
Besides... we don't want
to draw attention to ourselves.

00:24:19.280 --> 00:24:20.120
What?

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:25.530
Bye-bye, gods!

00:24:25.530 --> 00:24:27.280
Thank you!

00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:31.450
Saving people is great and all...

00:24:32.120 --> 00:24:35.530
but why'd you have to give them all our food?

00:24:35.870 --> 00:24:37.450
All we've got left is bread.

00:24:37.990 --> 00:24:40.370
I don't need to eat anything.

00:24:41.070 --> 00:24:44.780
You may be fine, but the rest
of us are practically starving!

00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:45.620
What?

00:24:50.990 --> 00:24:53.030
I'm so sorry, everyone!

00:24:53.280 --> 00:24:56.280
What's the deal with this idiot, anyways?!

00:24:56.280 --> 00:24:58.660
Hey, now. She's still a goddess, you know.

00:24:58.780 --> 00:25:01.370
I don't care if she's a goddess, an idiot's an idiot!

00:25:01.490 --> 00:25:04.120
She's the idiot patron of all other idiots!

00:25:04.570 --> 00:25:06.950
The most idiotic of them all!

00:25:05.620 --> 00:25:07.740
I don't even know how this happened...

00:25:07.740 --> 00:25:09.280
Is she really that different?

00:25:09.280 --> 00:25:10.200
Yeah.

00:25:10.530 --> 00:25:14.280
She's so bold and brave it's almost scary... like a heroine.

00:25:14.660 --> 00:25:17.700
Some guys spied on her bathing in Heaven once...

00:25:17.990 --> 00:25:20.240
You should be ashamed, you pigs!

00:25:20.320 --> 00:25:22.740
Thank you!

00:25:23.410 --> 00:25:27.320
Ah, I remember that day... Mm-hm...

00:25:27.660 --> 00:25:30.070
Well, the sun's about to go down.

00:25:30.200 --> 00:25:32.530
Why don't we make camp here for the night
and depart at dawn?

00:25:32.530 --> 00:25:35.280
What?! What about dinner?

00:25:35.280 --> 00:25:36.660
You'll just have to be hungry.

00:25:36.660 --> 00:25:38.200
Nooo!

00:25:38.200 --> 00:25:40.280
I'm starving...

00:25:40.280 --> 00:25:41.990
I-I'm sorry...

00:25:44.280 --> 00:25:45.780
I think we might be okay.

00:25:45.780 --> 00:25:46.700
What?

00:25:59.450 --> 00:26:01.200
Thanks for the food!

00:26:03.320 --> 00:26:05.410
Mmm... so good!

00:26:04.030 --> 00:26:05.410
Aha...

00:26:05.410 --> 00:26:06.910
Marsala fruit, huh?

00:26:06.910 --> 00:26:11.120
When heated up, the inner fruit
dissolves into a robust, rich juice.

00:26:11.120 --> 00:26:13.120
It's like a restaurant in the woods!

00:26:13.200 --> 00:26:14.530
Good thing you knew about these, Bell.

00:26:14.530 --> 00:26:16.070
Nice work, Master Bell!

00:26:17.120 --> 00:26:20.530
Orion, your knowledge seems pretty extensive.

00:26:20.530 --> 00:26:24.780
Nah, my grandpa just taught me a lot
about survival before I moved to Orario.

00:26:25.450 --> 00:26:26.240
Hm...?

00:26:26.910 --> 00:26:28.370
Aren't you going to eat?

00:26:28.820 --> 00:26:30.570
Oh, I'm all right...

00:26:31.200 --> 00:26:32.240
Okay...

00:26:34.950 --> 00:26:36.070
Say "ahh."

00:26:36.070 --> 00:26:36.780
Wha-?

00:26:36.780 --> 00:26:38.620
Here. Ahh...

00:26:38.620 --> 00:26:39.740
U-um...

00:26:39.910 --> 00:26:41.820
Like hell I'm gonna let you do that!

00:26:41.820 --> 00:26:43.700
Me first!

00:26:43.700 --> 00:26:45.780
Eat up!

00:26:46.200 --> 00:26:49.530
You're hurting my Bell! Back off, Supporter!

00:26:49.530 --> 00:26:51.240
Same to you, Lady Hestia!

00:26:53.410 --> 00:26:54.820
Anyways...

00:26:55.240 --> 00:26:56.990
What do you make of those monsters from earlier?

00:26:57.240 --> 00:27:01.370
I've seen scorpion-like monsters before,
but I've never seen anything like those.

00:27:01.370 --> 00:27:04.280
The woman said they've been attacking a nearby village.

00:27:05.200 --> 00:27:10.620
At first, people began to realize
that monsters were breeding at an alarming rate.

00:27:11.530 --> 00:27:15.370
Several Familias were dispatched
to investigate the cause...

00:27:16.530 --> 00:27:18.530
but none were heard from again.

00:27:19.410 --> 00:27:21.660
All evidence points to Ersos.

00:27:21.660 --> 00:27:25.320
A seal was placed within the ruins there long ago.

00:27:25.820 --> 00:27:28.320
A seal? For what purpose?

00:27:28.780 --> 00:27:30.200
A monster once corrupted the land there.

00:27:30.200 --> 00:27:35.320
Drank the sea, destroyed the forest,
fed on the life force of other beings.

00:27:35.910 --> 00:27:41.780
Long ago, the great spirits of old
sealed away that monster... Antares.

00:27:42.570 --> 00:27:43.740
Antares...?

00:27:44.370 --> 00:27:49.820
But over centuries of deep slumber,
it quietly built up its strength...

00:27:50.990 --> 00:27:53.160
and finally broke that seal.

00:27:53.780 --> 00:27:56.030
Broke the seal...?

00:27:56.530 --> 00:27:57.700
You mean...

00:28:00.570 --> 00:28:05.370
Yes... which is why Orario's
become heavily involved in this as well.

00:28:05.740 --> 00:28:07.700
My Familia and I were hired on to handle it.

00:28:08.820 --> 00:28:12.450
That's when we ran into Artemis,
in pursuit of the same goal.

00:28:13.280 --> 00:28:17.410
As you know, we ended up returning
to Orario to find reinforcements...

00:28:17.410 --> 00:28:20.700
Wait a sec. In that case, why not choose
a more powerful Familia...?

00:28:20.700 --> 00:28:21.570
No need.

00:28:22.950 --> 00:28:26.030
The only way to slay Antares is with that spear...

00:28:29.740 --> 00:28:33.660
...and the spear chose you to wield it.

00:28:37.030 --> 00:28:38.490
Oh, don't sound so grim!

00:28:38.490 --> 00:28:41.370
As long as we have the spear, it'll all be just fine!

00:28:41.370 --> 00:28:43.780
Come on, let's pick this up again
tomorrow after we've rested.

00:28:54.410 --> 00:28:58.280
And then the other day,
Bell didn't even bother waking me up.

00:28:58.620 --> 00:29:01.490
So, did you end up making it to work on time?

00:29:01.490 --> 00:29:05.200
Yeah, but barely. I was cutting it pretty close.

00:29:05.200 --> 00:29:08.120
If I'd actually been late,
Hephaistos woulda given me an earful.

00:29:09.240 --> 00:29:11.570
Hephaistos hasn't changed a bit, has she...

00:29:12.030 --> 00:29:14.870
I'd be in pretty deep trouble if I lost my job, though.

00:29:15.820 --> 00:29:19.200
Still, I can't believe you have your own Familia now.

00:29:19.700 --> 00:29:22.240
Yeah, it's still just me and Bell, though.

00:29:23.200 --> 00:29:24.120
Hestia?

00:29:24.490 --> 00:29:25.320
Yeah?

00:29:25.780 --> 00:29:28.990
What do you think of Orion?

00:29:29.780 --> 00:29:31.570
Wh-wh-what do I think?!

00:29:31.570 --> 00:29:33.490
He's just, like, my cute little family member!

00:29:33.490 --> 00:29:38.700
I mean, if we're being honest, he's much more than
that to me, and I dunno what I'd do without h-him...

00:29:43.740 --> 00:29:46.780
He's... someone very dear to me.

00:29:47.990 --> 00:29:52.990
I see... I get butterflies when I'm around him too.

00:29:53.530 --> 00:29:54.530
C-come again, now?

00:29:54.870 --> 00:29:57.530
I wonder what's making me feel that way...

00:29:57.530 --> 00:30:00.120
Y-you do know that Bell's part of MY Familia, right?!

00:30:00.450 --> 00:30:01.370
I know.

00:30:01.370 --> 00:30:03.570
Well then, stop thinking about him like that!

00:30:03.820 --> 00:30:04.700
Why?

00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:06.450
Why...?

00:30:07.280 --> 00:30:08.660
Where do I begin?!

00:30:08.660 --> 00:30:11.870
You were never even into stuff like that before, Artemis!

00:30:11.870 --> 00:30:12.990
I wasn't?

00:30:12.990 --> 00:30:16.660
Ugh! Where's the anti-romance friend I used to know?

00:30:20.570 --> 00:30:21.450
Hestia?

00:30:21.450 --> 00:30:25.280
Hey, Artemis? Where's your Familia right now?

00:30:28.280 --> 00:30:33.240
They're gone. But... they're waiting for me to return.

00:30:38.030 --> 00:30:39.490
You've changed a lot.

00:30:39.990 --> 00:30:41.370
I have?

00:30:41.820 --> 00:30:47.120
Mm-hm. For being an eternal, unchanging god,
you sure do seem different.

00:30:56.320 --> 00:30:57.990
Nothing ever seems to go my way...

00:30:59.820 --> 00:31:02.620
What'd you just say?! We can't leave Orario?

00:31:02.780 --> 00:31:04.240
Why the hell not?!

00:31:04.530 --> 00:31:06.990
It sounds like it came from the Guild.

00:31:07.280 --> 00:31:10.320
We're under strict orders not to leave the city.

00:31:10.320 --> 00:31:12.780
What about that job we've got down by the harbor?!

00:31:12.780 --> 00:31:14.570
It'll just have to wait.

00:31:15.320 --> 00:31:18.990
What do those idiots at the Guild
think they're doin'?! Damn fools!

00:31:19.620 --> 00:31:20.740
Miss Ais?

00:31:21.660 --> 00:31:23.780
Is there something wrong with the sky?

00:31:24.660 --> 00:31:25.620
No...

00:31:26.490 --> 00:31:27.490
Let's go.

00:31:27.490 --> 00:31:28.450
S-sure...

00:31:52.450 --> 00:31:53.910
What the hell happened...

00:31:53.910 --> 00:31:55.160
What is all that?

00:31:59.450 --> 00:32:02.200
The forest is... dying.

00:32:02.820 --> 00:32:04.620
This is Antares' doing.

00:32:05.870 --> 00:32:09.490
Over there... Those are the Ruins of Ersos.

00:32:14.740 --> 00:32:16.660
That's where we'll find Antares...

00:32:19.120 --> 00:32:20.280
Lady Artemis!

00:32:22.160 --> 00:32:23.240
It's coming...

00:32:28.030 --> 00:32:28.910
What is that?

00:32:29.490 --> 00:32:30.570
Look out!

00:32:34.530 --> 00:32:35.280
Damn it!

00:32:45.990 --> 00:32:47.820
Are you all right, Lady Artemis?

00:32:48.070 --> 00:32:49.070
I'm fine.

00:32:49.070 --> 00:32:50.280
The others...

00:32:53.240 --> 00:32:55.200
Goddess! Guys!

00:32:56.200 --> 00:32:57.780
Somehow, we made it!

00:32:59.370 --> 00:33:00.820
Are you okay?

00:33:02.740 --> 00:33:04.450
Lili! You're not hurt, are you?

00:33:04.450 --> 00:33:05.620
Master Bell!

00:33:05.990 --> 00:33:07.870
Almost all of us are fine...

00:33:08.320 --> 00:33:10.660
What the hell were those beams of light?

00:33:11.410 --> 00:33:12.910
I suspect it was me...

00:33:13.200 --> 00:33:16.740
No, more likely, it's the spear they're after.

00:33:21.490 --> 00:33:22.570
Monsters...

00:33:23.030 --> 00:33:24.660
This isn't good...

00:33:24.660 --> 00:33:27.240
Are these... like the last ones?

00:33:27.240 --> 00:33:30.240
No. These are bigger and shaped differently.

00:33:31.620 --> 00:33:34.570
Come, wandering wind. Wandering traveler.

00:33:35.120 --> 00:33:39.200
Cross the skies, dash through the wilderness,
race ahead at matchless speed.

00:33:39.700 --> 00:33:43.320
Carry the light of stardust and destroy the enemy!

00:33:43.450 --> 00:33:44.950
Luminous Wind!

00:33:51.450 --> 00:33:52.490
You all right?

00:33:54.820 --> 00:33:57.990
M-Miss Ryu...?

00:33:59.740 --> 00:34:00.910
Mr. Cranel.

00:34:02.240 --> 00:34:04.370
I never thought I'd run into you here.

00:34:04.870 --> 00:34:07.030
Same to you. What are you doing here?

00:34:07.240 --> 00:34:10.780
A group asked me to join them on a dangerous quest.

00:34:11.410 --> 00:34:12.660
That's them over there.

00:34:12.950 --> 00:34:13.990
Miss Asfi!

00:34:13.990 --> 00:34:15.660
The Hermes Familia!

00:34:16.820 --> 00:34:18.620
Master Hermes...!

00:34:19.530 --> 00:34:21.120
H-hi there, Asfi-

00:34:21.620 --> 00:34:23.030
Of all the idiotic things to do!

00:34:23.030 --> 00:34:26.410
Leaving us to guard the ruins so
that you could go home alone?!

00:34:26.410 --> 00:34:28.030
R-relax, Asfi...

00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:31.490
I told you I had to find someone to wield the spear.

00:34:31.490 --> 00:34:33.950
Still, I'd appreciate it if you wouldn't
just disappear like that!

00:34:34.160 --> 00:34:36.820
Asfi, please try to forgive Hermes.

00:34:36.820 --> 00:34:38.070
Lady Artemis...

00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:42.700
Bell Cranel...

00:34:44.450 --> 00:34:46.820
Was it you that pulled out the spear, then?

00:34:46.820 --> 00:34:50.820
To be honest, I was hoping for
a slightly more powerful Familia.

00:34:50.820 --> 00:34:52.070
I-I'm sorry...

00:34:53.450 --> 00:34:55.530
Well, Asfi? What's your report?

00:34:55.870 --> 00:34:57.320
It's only getting worse.

00:34:58.240 --> 00:35:02.120
They're encroaching further into the forest,
and the monsters only multiply.

00:35:02.950 --> 00:35:05.700
The neighboring villages have already been wiped out.

00:35:07.240 --> 00:35:08.570
What of our assault on the ruins?

00:35:09.200 --> 00:35:12.200
Failing, as we still haven't managed
to get past the doorway.

00:35:12.530 --> 00:35:13.450
I see...

00:35:13.950 --> 00:35:15.070
There's a doorway?

00:35:15.070 --> 00:35:15.990
Yes.

00:35:16.450 --> 00:35:19.410
It's the only thing preventing us from reaching Antares.

00:35:19.410 --> 00:35:20.700
You can't open it?

00:35:21.030 --> 00:35:22.740
Not with our power, no...

00:35:31.200 --> 00:35:32.280
Artemis.

00:35:34.240 --> 00:35:35.870
I need to talk to you about something.

00:35:41.660 --> 00:35:42.410
Huh?

00:35:45.620 --> 00:35:46.530
Bell?

00:35:47.910 --> 00:35:48.990
Master Hermes.

00:35:49.410 --> 00:35:53.870
I'm sure they have goddess gossiping to do.
Let's let them be for a while.

00:35:54.240 --> 00:35:56.160
I-I guess...

00:35:57.320 --> 00:36:00.570
So, are you gonna explain what
those lights were back there?

00:36:00.570 --> 00:36:02.030
What's going on?!

00:36:06.070 --> 00:36:10.200
You may look like Artemis,
but you are not the Artemis I knew.

00:36:11.410 --> 00:36:12.990
Who are you?

00:36:16.450 --> 00:36:20.280
This area is safe for now,
but the corruption could encroach upon us at any time.

00:36:21.030 --> 00:36:24.870
We've been using this as
a base camp to launch our attacks.

00:36:26.120 --> 00:36:28.240
Are you tired from the journey?

00:36:28.240 --> 00:36:31.410
There's a spring just up the path that's great for bathing.

00:36:31.410 --> 00:36:33.780
Really?! That sounds amazing!

00:36:33.780 --> 00:36:35.660
I feel like a sweaty mess!

00:36:35.660 --> 00:36:36.410
Bell.

00:36:36.410 --> 00:36:37.070
Huh?

00:36:39.070 --> 00:36:40.320
Master Hermes...?

00:36:40.990 --> 00:36:43.240
It's time for a crusade.

00:36:44.570 --> 00:36:46.700
Today, you boys become legends!

00:36:47.160 --> 00:36:52.620
Now, listen up! Beyond these dense trees
lies a maiden's paradise!

00:36:53.200 --> 00:36:57.910
Lili, Asfi, and the others cleansing the pure skin
they were blessed with at birth.

00:37:00.370 --> 00:37:01.870
And Artemis...

00:37:01.870 --> 00:37:07.660
Not a soul alive has laid eyes on the stark, pristine
beauty of her virgin goddess visage, man or god!

00:37:08.070 --> 00:37:10.120
My dream has been squashed once before,

00:37:10.120 --> 00:37:14.240
but right now, my heart is shouting at me,
telling me not to give up!

00:37:14.240 --> 00:37:16.530
And now, I have all of you.

00:37:16.740 --> 00:37:19.120
True comrades who share my ambition!

00:37:19.370 --> 00:37:22.780
A treacherous wall stands between us
and our prize, my boys!

00:37:22.780 --> 00:37:27.240
But should we conquer that wall today,
our names will be remembered for generations to come!

00:37:27.490 --> 00:37:29.320
Rise, my young fellows!

00:37:29.320 --> 00:37:31.570
Today, we become true heroes!

00:37:34.280 --> 00:37:35.200
Can I go home now?

00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:43.070
Heaven, be my witness! Grant these brave,
young heroes your divine protection! Onward!

00:37:45.070 --> 00:37:47.370
I suspected something like this might happen.

00:37:47.700 --> 00:37:50.120
I expected better from you, Master Welf.

00:37:50.490 --> 00:37:52.450
Men are such idiots.

00:37:52.450 --> 00:37:53.870
You're all perverted.

00:37:56.240 --> 00:37:57.620
I don't see Mr. Cranel.

00:37:57.620 --> 00:38:03.910
Bell! Run! Step over our corpses
and claim victory for yourself!

00:38:04.370 --> 00:38:07.780
Victory...? Have you seen Lady Artemis and Lady Hestia?

00:38:07.780 --> 00:38:13.200
Huh? Lady Hestia's already in bed for the night.
As for Lady Artemis... any idea?

00:38:13.620 --> 00:38:14.700
I dunno...

00:38:15.780 --> 00:38:18.160
I'm just not cut out for that kind of thing...

00:38:18.320 --> 00:38:19.450
No peeping for me.

00:38:20.030 --> 00:38:23.620
Although, this whole night's sort of
been giving me déjà vu...

00:38:41.570 --> 00:38:42.280
Who's there?!

00:38:42.280 --> 00:38:43.740
I-I'm sorry!

00:38:43.740 --> 00:38:47.240
It was an a-accident!
I swear I wasn't trying to peep on you...

00:38:47.240 --> 00:38:48.370
I-I'm gonna leave now!

00:38:48.370 --> 00:38:49.120
Wait.

00:38:54.870 --> 00:38:56.660
You're a lucky man.

00:38:57.030 --> 00:39:00.070
The old me probably would have shot you on sight.

00:39:01.240 --> 00:39:04.240
So the stories about you are true, then?

00:39:04.780 --> 00:39:06.530
Mm... What do you think?

00:39:06.530 --> 00:39:12.870
Um... Well, was Goddess... I mean Lady Hestia,
much different back then?

00:39:12.870 --> 00:39:17.700
She was. The Hestia I used
to know was a bit of a sloth.

00:39:17.700 --> 00:39:19.120
Everything was too much effort.

00:39:19.410 --> 00:39:22.240
Well, that part of her hasn't really changed.

00:39:22.660 --> 00:39:25.870
What else... She used to hide away in the temple a lot.

00:39:25.870 --> 00:39:27.030
Like a hermit?!

00:39:27.370 --> 00:39:33.870
Mm-hm. She'd get so excited every time I came to visit,
running around like a little puppy wanting to play.

00:39:33.870 --> 00:39:35.780
I can picture that in my mind so easily.

00:39:35.780 --> 00:39:36.620
Hestia.

00:39:37.990 --> 00:39:40.950
Is something wrong? You're all alone out here.

00:39:41.320 --> 00:39:42.910
I was just taking a walk.

00:39:42.910 --> 00:39:43.820
Oh...?

00:39:44.160 --> 00:39:46.160
Then why carry a spear you can't wield?

00:39:49.120 --> 00:39:51.620
You're not going to search for Bell then, huh?

00:39:52.200 --> 00:39:55.570
You know, he and Artemis could be
all alone together right now.

00:39:56.410 --> 00:40:00.070
Funny you should say that,
as the person pulling the strings...

00:40:01.570 --> 00:40:05.740
The closer their hearts are entwined,
the stronger the spear becomes.

00:40:07.030 --> 00:40:09.280
I know that you know, Hestia.

00:40:12.070 --> 00:40:13.410
Is it true...?

00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:16.660
Does it really have to be this spear?

00:40:16.660 --> 00:40:17.620
Yes.

00:40:18.320 --> 00:40:20.410
Is there really no other way?!

00:40:20.700 --> 00:40:23.700
If we just combine our strengths together,
we can defeat-

00:40:23.700 --> 00:40:24.370
Hestia!

00:40:27.530 --> 00:40:28.620
This is it...

00:40:29.490 --> 00:40:31.450
We're out of time and out of options.

00:40:33.370 --> 00:40:37.200
But... the Artemis here now is...

00:40:38.280 --> 00:40:39.620
She's not herself...

00:40:39.950 --> 00:40:40.870
She's different...

00:40:41.530 --> 00:40:42.660
And I...

00:40:44.910 --> 00:40:46.780
I feel so sorry for her.

00:40:47.740 --> 00:40:50.370
So you wanted to get rid of the spear?

00:40:53.950 --> 00:40:56.370
That was kind of you, Hestia...

00:41:02.700 --> 00:41:04.620
I've always envied her...

00:41:04.620 --> 00:41:08.620
the way she can cry with people, share in their joy...

00:41:09.410 --> 00:41:12.990
the way Hestia makes people smile
and shows them affection...

00:41:14.660 --> 00:41:17.280
I care a lot about her too.

00:41:20.410 --> 00:41:23.200
I'm sorry... for getting you mixed up in all of this.

00:41:23.200 --> 00:41:23.990
What?

00:41:24.990 --> 00:41:27.820
I'm forcing you to do such terrible things.

00:41:28.240 --> 00:41:29.870
Wha-? Not at all!

00:41:30.370 --> 00:41:33.660
I'll destroy any monster we come across!

00:41:33.990 --> 00:41:36.120
I promise I'll protect you!

00:41:38.740 --> 00:41:40.530
You sound a bit like a hero.

00:41:40.530 --> 00:41:42.660
What? N-not me...

00:41:42.950 --> 00:41:46.820
I mean, I did like reading about them
in storybooks when I was a kid.

00:41:51.620 --> 00:41:53.280
I envy those heroes.

00:41:54.450 --> 00:42:02.160
They can crush any beast, overcome any obstacle,
bring a smile to people's faces...

00:42:03.990 --> 00:42:06.160
There's never a damsel left in distress...

00:42:08.320 --> 00:42:09.740
They can save them all.

00:42:11.620 --> 00:42:13.660
That's the kind of hero I want to be.

00:42:14.660 --> 00:42:16.200
I think I get it now...

00:42:16.200 --> 00:42:17.030
Huh?

00:42:18.660 --> 00:42:22.160
Why Hestia always looks so happy
when she's around you.

00:42:23.070 --> 00:42:26.120
I know for certain that she's very fond of you.

00:42:26.120 --> 00:42:28.200
What?! N-n-no way!

00:42:28.450 --> 00:42:30.240
A goddess would never be interested in me!

00:42:32.320 --> 00:42:34.160
You said it yourself, didn't you?

00:42:34.660 --> 00:42:36.740
Goddesses are women too...

00:42:38.870 --> 00:42:43.490
I think... you have a lot of delusions about us gods.

00:42:46.450 --> 00:42:48.120
I'm the goddess of chastity.

00:42:48.780 --> 00:42:50.950
I forbade romance between man and woman...

00:42:50.950 --> 00:42:53.700
loathed their mere presence with one another.

00:42:54.280 --> 00:42:57.780
But one day, a child challenged those feelings...

00:42:58.660 --> 00:43:00.410
He told me that love is beautiful.

00:43:01.660 --> 00:43:02.870
And right now...

00:43:02.870 --> 00:43:04.780
I think I understand what he meant.

00:43:16.450 --> 00:43:17.570
Dance with me?

00:43:29.370 --> 00:43:42.910
The earth falls silent, gazing up at an eternal sky

00:43:46.320 --> 00:43:59.700
A brilliant moon waxes and wanes, the water shifts and sways

00:44:02.910 --> 00:44:09.280
All-encompassing emotion, a hidden kureilah

00:44:09.740 --> 00:44:15.370
The words of an incantation light up and dance

00:44:15.780 --> 00:44:21.240
A pure and noble offering, ureiah

00:44:21.870 --> 00:44:28.780
To keep me from awakening from this fleeting dream

00:44:31.910 --> 00:44:43.950
Heartbeats tick like a clock, weaving and melding together

00:44:38.570 --> 00:44:45.780
Did you know? Gods who descend to the lower world
can experience 10,000 years' worth of love?

00:44:44.490 --> 00:44:49.700
This new warmth I discovered

00:44:46.950 --> 00:44:48.910
10,000 years' worth of love...?

00:44:50.160 --> 00:44:56.820
Shall stay with me forever

00:44:50.700 --> 00:44:55.530
When our children pass on,
you're reborn in an endless cycle of love.

00:44:56.820 --> 00:45:01.200
Orion... I'm so glad that I met you.

00:44:57.820 --> 00:45:04.740
Kureilah, Ah

00:45:22.910 --> 00:45:28.030
As you all know, the areas around the ruins
are a nesting ground for monsters.

00:45:28.620 --> 00:45:32.570
Antares is storing up all of that power, even as we speak.

00:45:33.120 --> 00:45:37.530
There is no denying the horrors that
likely stand before us in this task.

00:45:38.070 --> 00:45:40.570
But you must not flinch! Do not fear!

00:45:41.370 --> 00:45:42.740
We will not accept defeat!

00:45:43.820 --> 00:45:45.870
Now then, I'll begin the briefing.

00:45:46.700 --> 00:45:48.820
Hermes Familia, you'll create a diversion.

00:45:49.410 --> 00:45:52.370
You need only lure them away. Don't overdo it.

00:45:52.370 --> 00:45:53.320
Understood!

00:45:53.320 --> 00:45:54.070
Falgar.

00:45:54.070 --> 00:45:54.530
Yes, ma'am!

00:45:54.530 --> 00:45:56.240
I'm leaving you in command.

00:45:56.660 --> 00:45:57.530
Understood!

00:45:59.490 --> 00:46:05.160
As for the rest, we wait for the enemy to disperse,
then storm the ruins while they're distracted

00:46:05.160 --> 00:46:06.450
and take down Antares!

00:46:06.780 --> 00:46:07.450
We...?

00:46:07.700 --> 00:46:10.950
The doorway won't open without my divine touch.

00:46:11.280 --> 00:46:12.450
I'm going with you.

00:46:12.450 --> 00:46:13.410
Lady Artemis!

00:46:13.700 --> 00:46:14.740
I'm going too.

00:46:16.950 --> 00:46:20.030
I'm not gonna let you go in there alone.

00:46:20.030 --> 00:46:22.950
Obviously, I'll be joining you all as well.

00:46:22.950 --> 00:46:25.450
Master Hermes, please! Don't do this-

00:46:27.410 --> 00:46:29.450
Now don't pretend you didn't see this coming!

00:46:29.450 --> 00:46:31.120
I don't like this...

00:46:32.990 --> 00:46:34.570
All right, let's get this done!

00:46:34.570 --> 00:46:37.030
I'm looking forward to the reward money.

00:46:37.030 --> 00:46:39.120
We like to keep our receipts in order.

00:46:39.280 --> 00:46:41.160
As do we, of course.

00:46:41.160 --> 00:46:42.740
You hush, Lil Squeak.

00:46:42.740 --> 00:46:44.450
I have a right to compensation!

00:46:44.450 --> 00:46:45.280
Exactly.

00:46:46.570 --> 00:46:47.990
Thank you, my children.

00:46:50.070 --> 00:46:52.030
This won't be an easy fight.

00:46:52.530 --> 00:46:54.370
We may suffer casualties.

00:46:54.370 --> 00:46:59.280
But we must triumph here,
to protect the lower world we love so dearly!

00:46:59.280 --> 00:47:00.870
Here, here!

00:47:00.990 --> 00:47:02.200
Let's go!

00:47:08.570 --> 00:47:09.530
I don't believe it...

00:47:10.200 --> 00:47:11.620
How did they ambush us?!

00:47:12.740 --> 00:47:14.660
Does it matter? This was our plan, right?

00:47:14.660 --> 00:47:17.410
True! They were just a little ahead of schedule.

00:47:17.410 --> 00:47:18.870
Make way!

00:47:23.870 --> 00:47:26.910
Go, Asfi! Your skills are needed elsewhere!

00:47:34.280 --> 00:47:35.950
We're counting on you, Asfi.

00:47:46.030 --> 00:47:48.160
I never knew these ruins existed...

00:47:48.660 --> 00:47:49.910
This place is massive.

00:47:51.870 --> 00:47:54.780
A temple to honor the gods of old, forgotten by history.

00:47:57.870 --> 00:47:59.120
It's so quiet.

00:48:00.280 --> 00:48:02.450
Don't forget, we were just ambushed back there.

00:48:02.450 --> 00:48:03.820
Keep your eyes open.

00:48:04.450 --> 00:48:05.490
Let's move.

00:48:13.870 --> 00:48:15.160
What's that glowing?

00:48:15.490 --> 00:48:16.780
It's the light of the seal.

00:48:17.450 --> 00:48:20.820
The spirits who placed it here were much like myself...

00:48:21.320 --> 00:48:24.700
Like ancient ancestors, one might say.

00:48:25.200 --> 00:48:26.700
From that long ago...?

00:48:29.280 --> 00:48:30.450
We're here.

00:48:31.620 --> 00:48:34.120
This is the sealed doorway we spoke about.

00:48:35.240 --> 00:48:36.820
Guess there's no turning back now.

00:48:37.490 --> 00:48:39.490
Antares is just beyond this door...

00:49:06.820 --> 00:49:08.450
Wh-what's that...?

00:49:09.370 --> 00:49:11.240
Something's nesting in the temple...

00:49:14.950 --> 00:49:15.910
How...

00:49:16.910 --> 00:49:19.450
I never imagined it on a scale like this...

00:49:22.780 --> 00:49:23.700
The exit!

00:49:35.410 --> 00:49:36.370
No...

00:49:36.660 --> 00:49:38.780
All of these are eggs?!

00:49:45.450 --> 00:49:46.320
Break past them!

00:49:58.200 --> 00:49:59.120
Goddess!

00:50:08.950 --> 00:50:09.910
Get back!

00:50:18.950 --> 00:50:19.870
No way...

00:50:19.870 --> 00:50:20.990
They're still alive!

00:50:21.910 --> 00:50:24.910
How...? My Burst Oil had no effect.

00:50:25.780 --> 00:50:28.410
Self-regeneration, reactive adaptation...

00:50:29.200 --> 00:50:32.990
They're evolving faster than
what should be possible in this place...

00:50:45.070 --> 00:50:48.740
Come, wandering wind. Wandering traveler.

00:50:49.160 --> 00:50:53.070
Cross the skies, dash through the wilderness,
race ahead at matchless speed.

00:50:54.070 --> 00:50:57.820
Carry the light of stardust and destroy the enemy!

00:50:57.820 --> 00:50:59.490
Luminous Wind!

00:51:05.160 --> 00:51:06.120
Did it work?

00:51:06.620 --> 00:51:09.370
No, they're still alive.

00:51:12.120 --> 00:51:15.820
At this rate, their numbers will surpass the Dungeon...

00:51:19.700 --> 00:51:22.030
Huh? How did that happen?

00:51:23.070 --> 00:51:25.950
What's wrong? You look so gloomy.

00:51:26.910 --> 00:51:27.950
My mug...

00:51:27.950 --> 00:51:30.030
Aw, looks like it cracked.

00:51:30.990 --> 00:51:33.160
It was one of my favorites, too...

00:51:33.530 --> 00:51:38.240
Hey... I haven't seen your buddy around recently.

00:51:38.240 --> 00:51:39.370
What's he up to?

00:51:40.620 --> 00:51:45.030
I heard he took on a quest from the Hermes Familia,
somewhere outside of Orario.

00:51:45.030 --> 00:51:46.410
Really?

00:51:46.780 --> 00:51:52.370
Wait, isn't there a special order prohibiting
adventurers from leaving the city right now?

00:51:52.700 --> 00:51:53.530
Yes...

00:51:55.870 --> 00:51:57.660
He's fine... right?

00:51:57.660 --> 00:51:59.910
Hey, does that look weird to you?

00:51:59.910 --> 00:52:01.450
My gods, that's creepy.

00:52:01.620 --> 00:52:02.740
What could that be?

00:52:04.700 --> 00:52:05.990
That wasn't there yesterday...

00:52:05.990 --> 00:52:07.370
Something's not right.

00:52:07.370 --> 00:52:08.620
It shouldn't be there at all.

00:52:08.870 --> 00:52:09.870
What is that?

00:52:10.320 --> 00:52:11.160
What's going on?

00:52:11.160 --> 00:52:13.160
Help!

00:52:15.700 --> 00:52:18.030
What's wrong? Are you all right, sir?

00:52:18.490 --> 00:52:19.910
Ba...

00:52:21.030 --> 00:52:22.240
Back up!

00:52:22.240 --> 00:52:23.820
Quick, get some adventurers!

00:52:23.820 --> 00:52:26.450
Wait, better make it first-class adventurers!

00:52:26.450 --> 00:52:28.240
P-please, calm down!

00:52:28.240 --> 00:52:29.660
What happened?

00:52:30.200 --> 00:52:32.200
There's too many for us to handle!

00:52:32.660 --> 00:52:33.910
The monsters...

00:52:36.820 --> 00:52:39.950
The monsters in the Dungeon are on a rampage!

00:52:40.160 --> 00:52:41.450
This ain't normal!

00:52:41.820 --> 00:52:45.740
If we don't act soon, the situation's
gonna be totally outta control!

00:52:47.570 --> 00:52:48.620
Understood.

00:52:49.370 --> 00:52:50.240
Bell...

00:53:00.450 --> 00:53:01.620
Fire Bolt!

00:53:11.910 --> 00:53:13.780
Master Bell, take this Elixir.

00:53:13.780 --> 00:53:15.280
Thanks, Lili.

00:53:20.950 --> 00:53:22.030
Hear that?

00:53:23.240 --> 00:53:24.280
We're close...

00:53:26.660 --> 00:53:27.820
Artemis?

00:53:27.950 --> 00:53:29.200
I'm fine.

00:53:30.990 --> 00:53:32.070
Let's keep moving.

00:53:36.740 --> 00:53:37.870
Don't do this.

00:53:46.620 --> 00:53:47.990
Go back home...

00:53:48.530 --> 00:53:50.370
You've done enough already...

00:53:50.660 --> 00:53:52.240
Please, go home.

00:53:52.660 --> 00:53:53.780
I'm gonna...

00:53:54.200 --> 00:53:55.990
We're gonna fix this, okay?

00:53:56.660 --> 00:53:57.820
Please...

00:54:00.950 --> 00:54:02.070
Artemis...

00:54:02.570 --> 00:54:04.030
I can't lose you...

00:54:09.990 --> 00:54:11.780
Thank you, Hestia.

00:54:44.240 --> 00:54:46.620
That's it... Antares.

00:55:01.200 --> 00:55:02.280
Lady Artemis!

00:55:03.240 --> 00:55:04.160
Shoot it...

00:55:04.740 --> 00:55:06.120
Please, Orion...

00:55:06.740 --> 00:55:07.820
Destroy it...

00:55:14.570 --> 00:55:15.660
It can't be...

00:55:15.660 --> 00:55:16.450
No...

00:55:16.620 --> 00:55:17.870
My gods...

00:55:18.320 --> 00:55:19.660
How could this happen...

00:55:20.320 --> 00:55:21.410
Why...

00:55:30.910 --> 00:55:32.120
Why...

00:55:33.490 --> 00:55:34.870
That's Lady Artemis.

00:55:48.700 --> 00:55:49.780
That beam!

00:55:51.950 --> 00:55:52.820
What's that?

00:56:20.490 --> 00:56:22.780
Lil Squeak. Lil Squeak.

00:56:23.870 --> 00:56:25.030
You all right?

00:56:25.370 --> 00:56:27.530
Master Welf... Is everyone okay?

00:56:27.740 --> 00:56:29.660
What's the meaning of this?!

00:56:29.660 --> 00:56:31.660
That beam was Arcanum, the power of the gods!

00:56:31.910 --> 00:56:33.910
How was that monster able to wield it?!

00:56:34.490 --> 00:56:36.910
Because it consumed Artemis' body...

00:56:42.990 --> 00:56:45.910
Master Welf, what happened
to Master Bell and Lady Artemis?!

00:56:47.070 --> 00:56:48.030
We got separated.

00:56:48.950 --> 00:56:50.320
They're probably somewhere below.

00:56:51.740 --> 00:56:52.780
Master Bell...

00:56:58.780 --> 00:57:00.820
Wh-who are they...?

00:57:01.530 --> 00:57:03.410
My children.

00:57:08.240 --> 00:57:10.280
All I could do was watch...

00:57:12.490 --> 00:57:16.240
Watch as the creature that devoured me
murdered my children...

00:57:17.200 --> 00:57:20.030
Watch them die by my own hand, one by one...

00:57:26.950 --> 00:57:28.320
I said I'd come back.

00:57:29.740 --> 00:57:33.120
Then... who is this person with me right now?

00:57:34.820 --> 00:57:36.820
The remnants of my spirit...

00:57:38.950 --> 00:57:42.030
Her thought-form dwells within the spear...

00:57:42.570 --> 00:57:44.410
The last remnants of her divine spirit.

00:57:45.870 --> 00:57:49.870
She's still Artemis in some ways, but in others, she is not.

00:57:50.820 --> 00:57:52.120
You mean...

00:57:52.700 --> 00:57:58.280
Now that its body is infused with her divine power,
Antares can bend the rules of nature.

00:57:59.740 --> 00:58:03.660
H-how can we expect to defeat something like that?!

00:58:03.950 --> 00:58:05.820
Us mortals don't stand a chance!

00:58:06.200 --> 00:58:08.530
Can't you gods do something about this?!

00:58:08.530 --> 00:58:09.530
I'm sorry...

00:58:12.160 --> 00:58:12.990
I'm sorry.

00:58:13.990 --> 00:58:15.030
What's happening?

00:58:14.490 --> 00:58:16.450
Something's not right.

00:58:21.700 --> 00:58:22.740
What is that?

00:58:23.370 --> 00:58:24.740
What's going on?

00:58:24.990 --> 00:58:26.370
Are there two moons...?

00:58:26.530 --> 00:58:27.570
No.

00:58:29.030 --> 00:58:30.700
That's no moon...

00:58:44.780 --> 00:58:45.910
The hell is goin' on?!

00:58:45.910 --> 00:58:48.200
Arcanum, I suspect.

00:58:48.530 --> 00:58:49.620
And that...

00:58:50.530 --> 00:58:53.570
That looks like Artemis' bow and arrow.

00:58:54.910 --> 00:58:59.620
Wielded by the goddess of purity,
the most powerful bow in all of Heaven...

00:59:01.070 --> 00:59:02.490
Duh! I ain't an idiot!

00:59:02.660 --> 00:59:06.120
But usin' over-the-top powers like that
in the lower world is way against the rules!

00:59:06.370 --> 00:59:10.780
If Artemis was stupid enough to do that,
she'd have been sent back to Heaven ages ago!

00:59:12.030 --> 00:59:15.740
Then perhaps... she's been apprehended.

00:59:18.240 --> 00:59:19.950
The Dungeon's shakin'...

00:59:21.280 --> 00:59:23.030
It must be frightened.

00:59:25.240 --> 00:59:28.870
After all, if that arrow fires off,
there won't be a lower world anymore.

00:59:29.740 --> 00:59:33.490
If the monsters breach the surface,
this place will be worse than a nightmare!

00:59:33.950 --> 00:59:35.160
Let's give them a war cry!

00:59:35.160 --> 00:59:36.950
Show them this is our city!

00:59:37.280 --> 00:59:39.160
Those monsters will never set foot here!

00:59:40.070 --> 00:59:41.370
We have one job to do!

00:59:41.910 --> 00:59:43.070
Defend to the end!

00:59:58.910 --> 01:00:00.490
Damn that ol' fool, Uranus!

01:00:00.870 --> 01:00:04.700
Keepin' us stranded in Orario
when he knew full well what was gonna happen!

01:00:04.700 --> 01:00:05.780
It's no use.

01:00:06.700 --> 01:00:11.030
Every god in Orario could band together
and it still wouldn't be enough to stop it.

01:00:11.030 --> 01:00:12.070
I don't care!

01:00:12.070 --> 01:00:15.200
Either way, we're the only ones here
that can do anything about it!

01:00:17.160 --> 01:00:18.200
Ottarl.

01:00:18.200 --> 01:00:19.160
Yes?

01:00:19.160 --> 01:00:20.740
Go and fight.

01:00:21.030 --> 01:00:22.370
Is that what you wish?

01:00:22.780 --> 01:00:23.660
Yes.

01:00:24.700 --> 01:00:27.620
There's nothing else we can do for the others now.

01:00:30.200 --> 01:00:32.450
There's only one way to defeat Antares.

01:00:32.700 --> 01:00:33.990
That spear you brought?

01:00:34.450 --> 01:00:37.200
In truth, it's more of an arrow than a spear.

01:00:37.700 --> 01:00:40.950
Just before Artemis was overtaken, or just after...

01:00:41.410 --> 01:00:46.320
she used her last bit of strength
to summon that arrow to the surface.

01:00:47.120 --> 01:00:48.370
A godly weapon...

01:00:48.370 --> 01:00:49.820
Godly weapon?

01:00:50.280 --> 01:00:52.370
Hephaistos told me about them once.

01:00:53.160 --> 01:00:54.530
They exist in Heaven...

01:00:55.990 --> 01:00:57.570
weapons that destroy even gods.

01:01:02.530 --> 01:01:04.070
Its name is Orion.

01:01:05.200 --> 01:01:08.780
In the language of the gods, it means "hunter."

01:01:10.950 --> 01:01:16.070
Antares may be lying in wait now,
but it could come for us at any moment.

01:01:20.240 --> 01:01:24.160
It's always been a monster,
but now that Antares possesses the power of a god,

01:01:24.950 --> 01:01:27.240
it's a disaster waiting to happen.

01:01:28.870 --> 01:01:33.320
The only way to kill it is by piercing its heart
with this nature-distorting arrow.

01:01:39.780 --> 01:01:41.120
Is that a bow and arrow?

01:01:41.620 --> 01:01:44.030
We're running out of time, Hermes.

01:01:46.030 --> 01:01:46.950
Wait...

01:01:49.070 --> 01:01:50.120
Asfi?

01:01:50.660 --> 01:01:56.120
Please don't tell me you're leaving the fate
of the entire world in Bell Cranel's hands...

01:01:57.530 --> 01:01:59.450
There's nothing else we can do.

01:02:01.490 --> 01:02:02.370
Still!

01:02:02.870 --> 01:02:05.570
How can you thrust all of this on one boy?!

01:02:05.950 --> 01:02:07.700
Killing a god is a mortal sin!

01:02:09.490 --> 01:02:10.320
No...

01:02:11.370 --> 01:02:12.490
No...

01:02:13.700 --> 01:02:17.740
That's not what this is about at all.

01:02:18.740 --> 01:02:19.740
No...

01:02:21.030 --> 01:02:22.160
You're lying.

01:02:23.160 --> 01:02:25.700
You can't ask me to do that...

01:02:26.910 --> 01:02:30.280
Why... Why did you choose me?

01:02:31.910 --> 01:02:34.280
I didn't come all this way with you to-!

01:02:34.820 --> 01:02:35.910
Just to-!

01:02:36.780 --> 01:02:37.950
To have to-!

01:03:03.910 --> 01:03:05.200
Damn you!

01:03:08.950 --> 01:03:09.910
Orion!

01:03:17.200 --> 01:03:20.820
Damn... you... to... hell! Bastard!

01:03:22.160 --> 01:03:23.030
Orion.

01:03:32.320 --> 01:03:34.870
I promised... I'd protect you...

01:03:35.910 --> 01:03:39.490
I'll destroy any monster we come across!

01:03:39.820 --> 01:03:41.950
I promise I'll protect you!

01:03:43.910 --> 01:03:45.030
I made...

01:03:45.620 --> 01:03:46.870
a promise...

01:03:48.370 --> 01:03:49.660
to protect you!

01:03:54.780 --> 01:03:56.120
Fire Bolt!

01:04:23.450 --> 01:04:25.200
Lady Artemis...

01:04:26.620 --> 01:04:27.660
Over there.

01:04:30.870 --> 01:04:32.740
Please, Orion!

01:04:33.490 --> 01:04:36.700
I need you to pierce through its heart with your arrow...

01:04:37.240 --> 01:04:38.620
before mine destroys you.

01:04:38.620 --> 01:04:40.700
Artemis!

01:04:54.280 --> 01:04:55.820
Artemis...

01:05:13.620 --> 01:05:14.570
This is bad!

01:05:14.570 --> 01:05:15.320
Come on!

01:05:15.320 --> 01:05:16.820
You two, go help Bell Cranel.

01:05:20.450 --> 01:05:22.370
Let's do what we can to buy some time.

01:05:22.370 --> 01:05:23.240
All right.

01:05:24.200 --> 01:05:24.990
Lil Squeak!

01:05:24.990 --> 01:05:25.820
Yeah?

01:05:25.820 --> 01:05:26.870
Take this.

01:05:28.200 --> 01:05:29.070
Your magic sword?

01:05:29.070 --> 01:05:30.990
We've only got one shot. Don't waste it!

01:05:30.990 --> 01:05:31.530
I won't!

01:05:55.280 --> 01:05:55.910
Lion!

01:06:09.370 --> 01:06:10.280
Hestia!

01:06:15.530 --> 01:06:17.320
What do we do? They just keep coming!

01:06:18.620 --> 01:06:21.070
Tsk! It's a whole damn stampede!

01:06:23.200 --> 01:06:24.160
A wyvern!

01:06:30.780 --> 01:06:34.450
Well, well... Now that's what I call back-up.

01:06:35.820 --> 01:06:38.740
I can't let this scum disturb Her Excellency.

01:06:39.990 --> 01:06:41.700
I'll fight beside you.

01:06:41.700 --> 01:06:42.950
Push them back!

01:06:57.990 --> 01:06:58.990
Everyone...

01:07:02.780 --> 01:07:03.910
Master Bell...

01:07:10.570 --> 01:07:11.490
Bell!

01:07:13.410 --> 01:07:15.280
Please, Bell, stand up!

01:07:15.990 --> 01:07:18.620
Don't let Artemis' sacrifice be in vain!

01:07:19.570 --> 01:07:21.620
We can't abandon the world she loved...

01:07:22.280 --> 01:07:23.990
the children she loved.

01:07:25.660 --> 01:07:26.950
Open your eyes.

01:07:28.240 --> 01:07:29.620
Listen to me!

01:07:31.200 --> 01:07:33.280
I know she's still crying in there.

01:07:36.530 --> 01:07:39.910
Save her from this! Please!

01:07:49.620 --> 01:07:52.240
Step away, Goddess...

01:07:54.700 --> 01:07:55.780
Master Bell.

01:08:07.780 --> 01:08:09.490
Oh no, you don't!

01:08:10.950 --> 01:08:13.280
Fire, Lil Squeak!

01:08:13.280 --> 01:08:14.820
Take this!

01:08:29.200 --> 01:08:31.200
Not today...

01:08:38.700 --> 01:08:39.820
Master Welf!

01:08:52.910 --> 01:08:53.990
Bell...

01:09:02.370 --> 01:09:04.240
I used to envy heroes...

01:09:05.410 --> 01:09:10.070
They can crush any beast,
bring a smile to people's faces...

01:09:11.030 --> 01:09:13.280
There's never a damsel left in distress...

01:09:15.700 --> 01:09:17.320
They can save anyone.

01:09:18.120 --> 01:09:20.240
That's the kind of hero I wanted to be!

01:09:26.870 --> 01:09:28.070
Artemis...

01:09:28.820 --> 01:09:31.780
Please, lend us your power for just a bit longer...

01:09:40.320 --> 01:09:41.200
Look.

01:09:41.740 --> 01:09:44.450
Lady Artemis' light...

01:09:57.200 --> 01:09:58.030
That's right...

01:09:59.070 --> 01:09:59.990
This...

01:10:00.870 --> 01:10:03.530
This isn't a story about killing a goddess.

01:10:06.320 --> 01:10:11.530
This is a story about you saving
a girl who's hurt and crying.

01:11:10.570 --> 01:11:11.910
Artemis...

01:11:12.620 --> 01:11:14.820
I used to envy you so much.

01:11:15.700 --> 01:11:20.280
Your strength, your poise, your kindness...

01:11:21.280 --> 01:11:27.320
Throughout our journey, I was constantly surprised
and worried by just how much you'd changed.

01:11:28.450 --> 01:11:29.570
But...

01:11:29.950 --> 01:11:31.070
it was fun.

01:11:31.780 --> 01:11:33.740
Really, truly fun...

01:12:03.030 --> 01:12:05.030
Artemis!

01:12:27.820 --> 01:12:30.620
Thank you, Orion.

01:12:51.160 --> 01:12:52.570
Lady Artemis...?

01:12:53.950 --> 01:12:55.030
Did you know...

01:12:55.700 --> 01:12:58.490
that when gods pass on, we're reborn as well?

01:13:00.070 --> 01:13:01.530
So keep smiling...

01:13:02.030 --> 01:13:03.660
for when we meet next time.

01:13:08.490 --> 01:13:10.240
When will that be?

01:13:10.910 --> 01:13:14.280
Who knows... A hundred years? A thousand?

01:13:15.200 --> 01:13:19.370
It could possibly be another 10,000 years.

01:13:19.950 --> 01:13:22.570
I don't think I'll still be around.

01:13:23.030 --> 01:13:23.570
No...

01:13:24.280 --> 01:13:28.530
but you will be reborn again,
somewhere in the lower world...

01:13:29.570 --> 01:13:32.570
And I know that someday we'll meet again.

01:13:38.070 --> 01:13:39.410
So listen...

01:13:40.160 --> 01:13:44.620
When that day eventually comes,
let's share 10,000 years' worth of love, Bell!

01:15:05.410 --> 01:15:06.620
We're saved!

01:15:06.620 --> 01:15:07.870
Woohoo!

01:15:08.160 --> 01:15:09.620
I owe you one now.

01:15:11.410 --> 01:15:14.490
I was only following orders.

01:15:17.160 --> 01:15:19.820
The chaos in the Dungeon has died down.

01:15:20.660 --> 01:15:27.030
Thanks in part to the Loki Familia,
we managed to get by with minimal damage to the city.

01:15:29.240 --> 01:15:33.620
The bow and arrow of Arcanum that
formed in the sky has dispersed as well.

01:15:34.410 --> 01:15:39.450
I suppose that must mean the ancient monster
was destroyed in the end.

01:15:40.410 --> 01:15:41.530
Uranus...

01:15:41.530 --> 01:15:43.620
What of the goddess, Artemis?

01:15:44.070 --> 01:15:45.280
She's passed on...

01:15:45.950 --> 01:15:48.990
her spirit set free by the hand of one boy.

01:15:50.160 --> 01:15:51.990
Bell Cranel.

01:15:57.070 --> 01:15:58.160
Master Hermes.

01:16:02.570 --> 01:16:03.620
It's all right...

01:16:04.370 --> 01:16:05.820
We'll be waiting for him.

01:16:09.240 --> 01:16:10.870
I couldn't save her...

01:16:12.620 --> 01:16:14.490
I promised I'd protect her.

01:16:16.450 --> 01:16:17.700
Bell...

01:16:18.910 --> 01:16:21.490
You may not be able to forgive yourself yet.

01:16:23.700 --> 01:16:24.910
But you know what?

01:16:25.870 --> 01:16:27.450
You did save her.

01:16:27.910 --> 01:16:29.240
Artemis...

01:16:30.120 --> 01:16:32.320
What makes you believe that?

01:16:32.870 --> 01:16:33.990
Well, look around...

01:16:49.280 --> 01:16:51.200
All of this beauty...

01:16:54.030 --> 01:16:55.870
It's her way of saying thank you.

01:17:03.160 --> 01:17:05.120
Was Artemis crying the whole time?

01:17:08.070 --> 01:17:10.030
She kept a smile on her face, didn't she?

01:17:11.280 --> 01:17:12.370
Yes...

01:17:17.450 --> 01:17:21.410
In the end, you became Artemis' hero.

01:17:24.450 --> 01:17:25.620
Goddess...

01:17:28.030 --> 01:17:30.620
I want to grow stronger.

01:17:34.950 --> 01:17:36.070
Okay.

01:18:00.910 --> 01:18:07.990
Itsuka mata deaeru tame ni furimukanaide
Don't look back, so that one day we can meet again

01:18:07.990 --> 01:18:10.570
Egao de "Mata ne"
With a smile, I say "Bye for now"

01:18:10.570 --> 01:18:19.450
See you, my love

01:18:31.280 --> 01:18:35.780
Oka no ue, kata o narabete
We stand side by side atop that hill

01:18:35.780 --> 01:18:40.820
Tsuki o miagete, koraeta namida
Holding back tears, I gaze up at the moon

01:18:40.820 --> 01:18:45.820
Hon no sukoshi no kanashimi to
That faint sadness

01:18:45.820 --> 01:18:50.780
Tsukasadotta unmei ga
A fate that governs us

01:18:51.200 --> 01:18:53.870
Mezasu sono basho wa
The place we both aim for

01:18:53.870 --> 01:18:56.740
Kokoro kara ai shita
They are a future I hold dear

01:18:56.740 --> 01:19:03.320
Kimi to no taisetsu na mirai
One with you, whom I've loved with all my heart

01:19:03.320 --> 01:19:08.490
Kanarazu mata ai ni iku kara
I will come for you again, trust me

01:19:08.820 --> 01:19:13.620
Furimukanaide, egao de "Mata ne"
Don't look back, with a smile I say "Bye for now"

01:19:13.620 --> 01:19:19.160
Hanarete itemo kimi to nara
Even when we're apart, you and I

01:19:19.160 --> 01:19:24.070
Tsunagatteru kokoro ga aru to
Are connected in our hearts

01:19:24.070 --> 01:19:29.870
Shinjite iru kara ne
I truly believe it

01:19:30.450 --> 01:19:37.280
Donna toki mo, zutto
No matter what, always

01:19:41.700 --> 01:19:46.570
Uchihanatareta ya no you ni
A comet flies past

01:19:46.570 --> 01:19:51.530
Nagareru houkiboshi e to
Like an arrow that's been let loose

01:19:51.910 --> 01:19:54.620
Negaikometa toki
When I wish upon it

01:19:54.620 --> 01:19:57.370
Kokoro no door ga aku
The door of my heart will open

01:19:57.370 --> 01:20:03.950
Atarashii sekai no kanata
To a new world far away

01:20:04.120 --> 01:20:09.320
Kanarazu mata ai ni iku kara
I will come for you again, trust me

01:20:09.320 --> 01:20:14.240
Furimukanaide, egao de "Mata ne"
Don't look back, with a smile I say "Bye for now"

01:20:14.240 --> 01:20:19.740
Yakusoku nante nai keredo
I can't make any promises

01:20:19.740 --> 01:20:24.820
Itsuka kitto kanaerareru to
But one day, for sure, we can make it happen

01:20:24.820 --> 01:20:30.530
Shinjite iru kara ne
I truly believe it

01:20:30.990 --> 01:20:34.780
Donna toki mo
No matter what

01:20:35.030 --> 01:20:39.870
Tatoeru naraba kimi to iru sekai
To draw a comparison, a world with you in it

01:20:39.870 --> 01:20:44.620
Yuumagure no you ni atatakai to
Is warm like evening twilight

01:20:44.780 --> 01:20:50.160
Kono kokoro de kanjite iru
I feel it in my heart

01:20:50.160 --> 01:20:55.740
Dakara alright nani ga okitemo
So it will be alright, no matter what happens

01:21:02.160 --> 01:21:07.410
Kanarazu mata ai ni iku kara
I will come for you again, trust me

01:21:07.410 --> 01:21:12.200
Furimukanaide, egao de "Mata ne"
Don't look back, with a smile I say "Bye for now"

01:21:12.200 --> 01:21:17.950
Hanarete itemo kimi to nara
Even when we're apart, you and I

01:21:17.950 --> 01:21:22.950
Tsunagatteru kokoro ga aru to
Are connected in our hearts

01:21:22.950 --> 01:21:27.490
Shinjite iru kara ne
I truly believe it

01:21:28.030 --> 01:21:33.660
Onaji sora no shita de
We're beneath the same sky

01:21:34.370 --> 01:21:41.320
Donna toki mo, zutto
No matter what happens, always

01:21:43.160 --> 01:21:46.280
Zutto
Always
